    <paragraph>Amelio is shopping for textbooks online. He found three sellers that are offering a book he needs for the same price, including shipping. To decide which seller to buy from he is comparing their customer satisfaction ratings. The ratings are given in the chart.</paragraph>
    <paragraph>Use the chart to answer the following questions</paragraph>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <row>
          <cell header="true">Seller</cell>
          <cell header="true">Rating</cell>
        </row>
      </thead>
